    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46946" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλῠθον</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρχομαι</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦλυξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠγος</span>, ὁ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλύγη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Choerob.
				<u>in Theod.</u>
				2.400
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλύγων ὀρέων: ἐν σκότῳ
				κατεχομένων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> (leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-αίων</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλυξα</span></b> , 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύσκω</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠλῠσίη</span></b> , ἡ, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤλυσις, ὁδός</span>
			, Id., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				497.9
			</span></i>.</div>
